	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"The Vessels are what you do when the dragon is dead. These are what you do instead."
				""
				"Every one of these roads was walked by somebody in one of the nine civilisations,"
				"and every one of them is the reason that civilisation is a ruin you can visit."
				""
				"The archive does not rank them. It only notes that nobody has ever walked two."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:compass"
			id: "0660D0D2C445B393"
			shape: "octagon"
			size: 1.8d
			subtitle: "Six ways to spend a life."
			tasks: [{
				id: "614EB7C1E538836B"
				title: "Read"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "The Long Roads"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0660D0D2C445B393"]
			description: [
				"Every road on the previous pages was written down by somebody who thought"
				"it was worth writing down."
				""
				"These three were not. They are here because somebody went looking through"
				"what nobody had catalogued, which is , the Convent would point out , exactly"
				"how all the other roads were found in the first place."
			]
			icon: "cuffed:poster"
			id: "079287A633FE63EA"
			shape: "octagon"
			size: 1.8d
			subtitle: "Four the archive forgot to file."
			tasks: [{
