		{
			dependencies: ["6B25CBCEDAC3B6CB"]
			description: [
				"A Ruptured Idol is a remnant with an energy in it that has not decided anything yet."
				"A Runic Tablet on either side, and then the recipe forks , and the fork is a mirror:"
				""
				"  gold, an enchanted apple, water, diamond   ->  ASCENDED. Blessed."
				"  blaze powder, lava, obsidian, an ender eye ->  TARNISHED. Accursed."
				""
				"⚠ Neither is a damage weapon. Both are maces with baseline damage and an aura:"
				"the Ascended spreads holy water, regenerates you and cures what is wrong with you."
				"The Tarnished spreads unholy water and inflicts wither and weakness on everything near."
				""
				"Heal yourself or rot everything around you. The archive files both under *idol*"
				"and declines, as usual, to say which one it means by the word."
			]
